Package: annual.updates
Type: Package
Title: AQLI Annual Update Figures, Data, and Code
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Air Quality Life Index, Energy Policy Institute at the University of Chicago
Maintainer: Air Quality Life Index <https://aqli.epic.uchicago.edu>
Description: Figures, underlying datasets, and code for AQLI annual reports,
    factsheets, and related analyses. This repository is a research archive.
    It is not built or installed as an R package. Shared helpers live in R/.
    Each Shiny app keeps its own renv.lock (R 4.3.3).
